"""DMG3402L-7 30 V logic-level N-channel MOSFET in SOT-23.

The manufacturer datasheet guarantees 85 mOhm maximum on-resistance at
VGS = 2.5 V and ID = 2 A. Pin mapping is pin 1 gate, pin 2 source and pin 3
drain. The imported LCSC footprint contains the matching embedded STEP model.
"""

D = io(Net)
G = io(Net)
S = io(Net)

Component(
    name="DMG3402L-7",
    symbol=Symbol(library="DMG3402L-7.kicad_sym"),
    pins={"D": D, "G": G, "S": S},
    properties={"JLCPCB": "C96614"},
)
